{"video_id": "A3gs7cmahjU", "channel_id": "UClzcGZhMyjX5BVDXk4fmiNg", "fetched_at": "2026-11-17T19:00:00.505226+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "auto_generated", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 0.65, "end_seconds": 2.67, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_seconds": 3.0, "end_seconds": 8.28, "text": ">> Use an EventBridge schedule to invoke"}, {"start_seconds": 5.48, "end_seconds": 10.2, "text": "Lambda at a configured time, pass JSON"}, {"start_seconds": 8.28, "end_seconds": 13.28, "text": "input, and confirm the result in"}, {"start_seconds": 10.2, "end_seconds": 13.28, "text": "CloudWatch logs."}, {"start_seconds": 13.36, "end_seconds": 16.44, "text": "The workflow is straightforward, but"}, {"start_seconds": 15.12, "end_seconds": 17.84, "text": "each component has a distinct"}, {"start_seconds": 16.44, "end_seconds": 19.88, "text": "responsibility."}, {"start_seconds": 17.84, "end_seconds": 22.12, "text": "Start with an EventBridge schedule. It"}, {"start_seconds": 19.88, "end_seconds": 23.84, "text": "defines when a target should be invoked."}, {"start_seconds": 22.12, "end_seconds": 25.76, "text": "In this exercise, that target is a"}, {"start_seconds": 23.84, "end_seconds": 27.72, "text": "Lambda function, and the schedule is"}, {"start_seconds": 25.76, "end_seconds": 29.56, "text": "configured for one specific future date"}, {"start_seconds": 27.72, "end_seconds": 30.76, "text": "and time, rather than as a recurring"}, {"start_seconds": 29.56, "end_seconds": 32.44, "text": "schedule."}, {"start_seconds": 30.76, "end_seconds": 34.44, "text": "At the configured time, EventBridge"}, {"start_seconds": 32.44, "end_seconds": 36.96, "text": "invokes the selected Lambda function and"}, {"start_seconds": 34.44, "end_seconds": 38.96, "text": "supplies the JSON input you configured."}, {"start_seconds": 36.96, "end_seconds": 40.28, "text": "Lambda prints the received event."}, {"start_seconds": 38.96, "end_seconds": 42.4, "text": "Because the function has permission to"}, {"start_seconds": 40.28, "end_seconds": 43.96, "text": "write logs, Lambda writes that output to"}, {"start_seconds": 42.4, "end_seconds": 45.64, "text": "CloudWatch logs."}, {"start_seconds": 43.96, "end_seconds": 47.84, "text": "That output becomes the verification"}, {"start_seconds": 45.64, "end_seconds": 49.64, "text": "point. You can inspect the message that"}, {"start_seconds": 47.84, "end_seconds": 51.08, "text": "Lambda actually received after the"}, {"start_seconds": 49.64, "end_seconds": 52.52, "text": "schedule runs."}, {"start_seconds": 51.08, "end_seconds": 55.56, "text": "Keep this flow in mind throughout the"}, {"start_seconds": 52.52, "end_seconds": 58.28, "text": "lesson. Schedule, target, event output,"}, {"start_seconds": 55.56, "end_seconds": 58.28, "text": "then logs."}, {"start_seconds": 58.32, "end_seconds": 62.12, "text": "Several schedule settings deserve"}, {"start_seconds": 60.32, "end_seconds": 64.48, "text": "deliberate attention."}, {"start_seconds": 62.12, "end_seconds": 66.48, "text": "First, choose a date and time that is"}, {"start_seconds": 64.48, "end_seconds": 67.92, "text": "still in the future when you create the"}, {"start_seconds": 66.48, "end_seconds": 70.16, "text": "schedule."}, {"start_seconds": 67.92, "end_seconds": 72.8, "text": "A time that has already passed will not"}, {"start_seconds": 70.16, "end_seconds": 74.2, "text": "produce the intended demonstration."}, {"start_seconds": 72.8, "end_seconds": 76.52, "text": "Give yourself several minutes to"}, {"start_seconds": 74.2, "end_seconds": 79.4, "text": "complete configuration."}, {"start_seconds": 76.52, "end_seconds": 80.68, "text": "Next, select the correct time zone."}, {"start_seconds": 79.4, "end_seconds": 83.2, "text": "The displayed schedule time is"}, {"start_seconds": 80.68, "end_seconds": 84.56, "text": "interpreted using that selected zone."}, {"start_seconds": 83.2, "end_seconds": 87.92, "text": "So, a wrong choice can make an"}, {"start_seconds": 84.56, "end_seconds": 90.12, "text": "invocation appear late or missing."}, {"start_seconds": 87.92, "end_seconds": 91.68, "text": "For this exercise, disable the flexible"}, {"start_seconds": 90.12, "end_seconds": 93.24, "text": "time window."}, {"start_seconds": 91.68, "end_seconds": 95.72, "text": "That avoids intentionally giving the"}, {"start_seconds": 93.24, "end_seconds": 97.4, "text": "scheduler a flexible execution window"}, {"start_seconds": 95.72, "end_seconds": 99.92, "text": "and keeps the demonstration focused on"}, {"start_seconds": 97.4, "end_seconds": 101.64, "text": "the configured time."}, {"start_seconds": 99.92, "end_seconds": 103.04, "text": "Finally, set the action after completion"}, {"start_seconds": 101.64, "end_seconds": 104.44, "text": "to none."}, {"start_seconds": 103.04, "end_seconds": 106.92, "text": "The schedule remains available for"}, {"start_seconds": 104.44, "end_seconds": 110.32, "text": "inspection or editing after it runs,"}, {"start_seconds": 106.92, "end_seconds": 113.08, "text": "rather than being deleted automatically."}, {"start_seconds": 110.32, "end_seconds": 115.4, "text": "Begin by creating a Lambda function,"}, {"start_seconds": 113.08, "end_seconds": 117.64, "text": "using Python for this example."}, {"start_seconds": 115.4, "end_seconds": 119.88, "text": "The specific current Python version is"}, {"start_seconds": 117.64, "end_seconds": 122.56, "text": "not the key point. The function must be"}, {"start_seconds": 119.88, "end_seconds": 124.64, "text": "able to run the supplied script."}, {"start_seconds": 122.56, "end_seconds": 126.88, "text": "Then confirm that its execution role"}, {"start_seconds": 124.64, "end_seconds": 129.48, "text": "provides the CloudWatch logs permissions"}, {"start_seconds": 126.88, "end_seconds": 131.08, "text": "required for Lambda to write output."}, {"start_seconds": 129.48, "end_seconds": 132.24, "text": "The function itself is intentionally"}, {"start_seconds": 131.08, "end_seconds": 133.56, "text": "simple."}, {"start_seconds": 132.24, "end_seconds": 135.68, "text": "The handler prints the event it"}, {"start_seconds": 133.56, "end_seconds": 137.28, "text": "receives, allowing you to inspect the"}, {"start_seconds": 135.68, "end_seconds": 139.04, "text": "schedule payload in the logs after"}, {"start_seconds": 137.28, "end_seconds": 140.64, "text": "invocation."}, {"start_seconds": 139.04, "end_seconds": 143.24, "text": "The handler does not need complex"}, {"start_seconds": 140.64, "end_seconds": 145.08, "text": "business logic for this exercise."}, {"start_seconds": 143.24, "end_seconds": 147.4, "text": "Before you build the schedule, deploy"}, {"start_seconds": 145.08, "end_seconds": 149.24, "text": "the updated function code. Deploying"}, {"start_seconds": 147.4, "end_seconds": 151.12, "text": "first prevents a common operational"}, {"start_seconds": 149.24, "end_seconds": 153.12, "text": "mistake, successfully scheduling a"}, {"start_seconds": 151.12, "end_seconds": 156.08, "text": "function whose intended handler changes"}, {"start_seconds": 153.12, "end_seconds": 156.08, "text": "were never deployed."}, {"start_seconds": 156.8, "end_seconds": 160.4, "text": "A major troubleshooting and exam"}, {"start_seconds": 158.76, "end_seconds": 162.32, "text": "distinction is the difference between"}, {"start_seconds": 160.4, "end_seconds": 164.92, "text": "the two roles involved."}, {"start_seconds": 162.32, "end_seconds": 166.56, "text": "The Lambda execution role is used after"}, {"start_seconds": 164.92, "end_seconds": 168.48, "text": "the function starts."}, {"start_seconds": 166.56, "end_seconds": 170.96, "text": "In this lesson, it allows the running"}, {"start_seconds": 168.48, "end_seconds": 173.04, "text": "function to write its printed output to"}, {"start_seconds": 170.96, "end_seconds": 174.6, "text": "CloudWatch logs."}, {"start_seconds": 173.04, "end_seconds": 175.8, "text": "The EventBridge invocation role is"}, {"start_seconds": 174.6, "end_seconds": 177.08, "text": "different."}, {"start_seconds": 175.8, "end_seconds": 178.8, "text": "It gives the scheduling service"}, {"start_seconds": 177.08, "end_seconds": 180.24, "text": "permission to invoke the selected Lambda"}, {"start_seconds": 178.8, "end_seconds": 181.8, "text": "target."}, {"start_seconds": 180.24, "end_seconds": 184.24, "text": "During schedule creation, the console"}, {"start_seconds": 181.8, "end_seconds": 185.64, "text": "can create a new role for this purpose."}, {"start_seconds": 184.24, "end_seconds": 186.96, "text": "These permissions are conceptually"}, {"start_seconds": 185.64, "end_seconds": 188.36, "text": "separate."}, {"start_seconds": 186.96, "end_seconds": 190.56, "text": "A function might work when manually"}, {"start_seconds": 188.36, "end_seconds": 192.8, "text": "tested because its execution role is"}, {"start_seconds": 190.56, "end_seconds": 194.8, "text": "valid, while the schedule still cannot"}, {"start_seconds": 192.8, "end_seconds": 197.28, "text": "invoke it because EventBridge lacks"}, {"start_seconds": 194.8, "end_seconds": 199.08, "text": "target invocation permission."}, {"start_seconds": 197.28, "end_seconds": 201.56, "text": "When diagnosing a failed scheduled"}, {"start_seconds": 199.08, "end_seconds": 203.6, "text": "invocation, do not assume that Lambda"}, {"start_seconds": 201.56, "end_seconds": 206.72, "text": "logging permissions solve EventBridge"}, {"start_seconds": 203.6, "end_seconds": 206.72, "text": "invocation permissions."}, {"start_seconds": 209.4, "end_seconds": 213.88, "text": "A Lambda function works when manually"}, {"start_seconds": 211.68, "end_seconds": 216.4, "text": "tested, but its EventBridge schedule"}, {"start_seconds": 213.88, "end_seconds": 218.0, "text": "cannot invoke it. Which permission area"}, {"start_seconds": 216.4, "end_seconds": 219.76, "text": "should you check first?"}, {"start_seconds": 218.0, "end_seconds": 221.52, "text": "Pause and separate what starts the"}, {"start_seconds": 219.76, "end_seconds": 223.72, "text": "function from what the function does"}, {"start_seconds": 221.52, "end_seconds": 226.24, "text": "after it starts. The correct answer is"}, {"start_seconds": 223.72, "end_seconds": 228.0, "text": "B. Check the schedule target invocation"}, {"start_seconds": 226.24, "end_seconds": 229.36, "text": "role and its permission to invoke"}, {"start_seconds": 228.0, "end_seconds": 231.24, "text": "Lambda."}, {"start_seconds": 229.36, "end_seconds": 233.32, "text": "The execution role supports the running"}, {"start_seconds": 231.24, "end_seconds": 235.32, "text": "function, including CloudWatch logs"}, {"start_seconds": 233.32, "end_seconds": 237.48, "text": "output."}, {"start_seconds": 235.32, "end_seconds": 240.24, "text": "In the EventBridge console, open the"}, {"start_seconds": 237.48, "end_seconds": 242.4, "text": "schedules area and create a schedule."}, {"start_seconds": 240.24, "end_seconds": 244.6, "text": "Give the schedule a descriptive name, so"}, {"start_seconds": 242.4, "end_seconds": 246.28, "text": "its purpose is clear during operations"}, {"start_seconds": 244.6, "end_seconds": 248.28, "text": "and troubleshooting."}, {"start_seconds": 246.28, "end_seconds": 250.56, "text": "For this simple exercise, the default"}, {"start_seconds": 248.28, "end_seconds": 252.04, "text": "schedule group is appropriate. Select a"}, {"start_seconds": 250.56, "end_seconds": 253.04, "text": "date and time several minutes in the"}, {"start_seconds": 252.04, "end_seconds": 255.24, "text": "future."}, {"start_seconds": 253.04, "end_seconds": 257.28, "text": "Then choose the appropriate time zone."}, {"start_seconds": 255.24, "end_seconds": 258.64, "text": "Use the 24-hour time format shown by the"}, {"start_seconds": 257.28, "end_seconds": 260.76, "text": "console."}, {"start_seconds": 258.64, "end_seconds": 262.8, "text": "If setup takes longer than expected and"}, {"start_seconds": 260.76, "end_seconds": 264.48, "text": "the selected time passes, update the"}, {"start_seconds": 262.8, "end_seconds": 265.8, "text": "schedule before waiting for any"}, {"start_seconds": 264.48, "end_seconds": 267.96, "text": "invocation."}, {"start_seconds": 265.8, "end_seconds": 270.24, "text": "This is not a Lambda code problem. It is"}, {"start_seconds": 267.96, "end_seconds": 272.28, "text": "a timing configuration problem."}, {"start_seconds": 270.24, "end_seconds": 274.68, "text": "Leave the flexible time window disabled,"}, {"start_seconds": 272.28, "end_seconds": 278.36, "text": "as discussed earlier, so the exercise is"}, {"start_seconds": 274.68, "end_seconds": 278.36, "text": "based on the configured schedule time."}, {"start_seconds": 278.48, "end_seconds": 283.84, "text": "Now configure the target."}, {"start_seconds": 280.68, "end_seconds": 286.12, "text": "Choose AWS Lambda as the target service."}, {"start_seconds": 283.84, "end_seconds": 288.64, "text": "Then choose the intended function."}, {"start_seconds": 286.12, "end_seconds": 290.4, "text": "Next, paste the JSON input payload that"}, {"start_seconds": 288.64, "end_seconds": 292.88, "text": "should be delivered to Lambda."}, {"start_seconds": 290.4, "end_seconds": 294.84, "text": "The payload must remain valid JSON. If"}, {"start_seconds": 292.88, "end_seconds": 297.12, "text": "you change the sample message, edit the"}, {"start_seconds": 294.84, "end_seconds": 299.2, "text": "value inside the quotation marks without"}, {"start_seconds": 297.12, "end_seconds": 301.24, "text": "breaking the JSON structure."}, {"start_seconds": 299.2, "end_seconds": 303.56, "text": "When prompted for permissions, choose"}, {"start_seconds": 301.24, "end_seconds": 305.04, "text": "the option to create a new role."}, {"start_seconds": 303.56, "end_seconds": 306.72, "text": "That role gives the schedule the"}, {"start_seconds": 305.04, "end_seconds": 308.32, "text": "permission required to invoke the"}, {"start_seconds": 306.72, "end_seconds": 310.48, "text": "selected function."}, {"start_seconds": 308.32, "end_seconds": 311.84, "text": "Leave other settings unchanged unless"}, {"start_seconds": 310.48, "end_seconds": 313.4, "text": "your use case requires a different"}, {"start_seconds": 311.84, "end_seconds": 315.56, "text": "configuration."}, {"start_seconds": 313.4, "end_seconds": 317.0, "text": "Set the post completion action to none,"}, {"start_seconds": 315.56, "end_seconds": 319.2, "text": "so the one-time schedule remains"}, {"start_seconds": 317.0, "end_seconds": 321.04, "text": "available after execution."}, {"start_seconds": 319.2, "end_seconds": 322.24, "text": "Keeping it is useful for inspection or"}, {"start_seconds": 321.04, "end_seconds": 323.64, "text": "editing."}, {"start_seconds": 322.24, "end_seconds": 327.88, "text": "But remember that it must later be"}, {"start_seconds": 323.64, "end_seconds": 327.88, "text": "deleted manually when no longer needed."}, {"start_seconds": 328.12, "end_seconds": 332.08, "text": "Treat the schedule input as a"}, {"start_seconds": 329.88, "end_seconds": 333.12, "text": "configuration artifact, not as casual"}, {"start_seconds": 332.08, "end_seconds": 334.64, "text": "text."}, {"start_seconds": 333.12, "end_seconds": 337.2, "text": "The function receives the configured"}, {"start_seconds": 334.64, "end_seconds": 339.44, "text": "JSON object as its event."}, {"start_seconds": 337.2, "end_seconds": 341.28, "text": "The safe change is to edit the message"}, {"start_seconds": 339.44, "end_seconds": 343.2, "text": "value while preserving the JSON"}, {"start_seconds": 341.28, "end_seconds": 344.64, "text": "structure, including the required"}, {"start_seconds": 343.2, "end_seconds": 346.44, "text": "quotation marks."}, {"start_seconds": 344.64, "end_seconds": 348.72, "text": "Removing quotes or changing other"}, {"start_seconds": 346.44, "end_seconds": 350.04, "text": "structure carelessly, can invalidate the"}, {"start_seconds": 348.72, "end_seconds": 351.56, "text": "payload."}, {"start_seconds": 350.04, "end_seconds": 353.88, "text": "If the function logs an unexpected"}, {"start_seconds": 351.56, "end_seconds": 355.84, "text": "message, do not immediately assume a"}, {"start_seconds": 353.88, "end_seconds": 357.92, "text": "Lambda runtime problem."}, {"start_seconds": 355.84, "end_seconds": 360.44, "text": "Review the selected target function and"}, {"start_seconds": 357.92, "end_seconds": 361.88, "text": "the schedule's JSON input payload."}, {"start_seconds": 360.44, "end_seconds": 364.32, "text": "A schedule can successfully invoke"}, {"start_seconds": 361.88, "end_seconds": 367.12, "text": "Lambda while still delivering the wrong"}, {"start_seconds": 364.32, "end_seconds": 367.12, "text": "configured data."}, {"start_seconds": 368.4, "end_seconds": 372.48, "text": "After the scheduled time has passed,"}, {"start_seconds": 370.72, "end_seconds": 373.68, "text": "verify execution through the Lambda"}, {"start_seconds": 372.48, "end_seconds": 375.88, "text": "console."}, {"start_seconds": 373.68, "end_seconds": 377.56, "text": "In the Lambda console, open the function"}, {"start_seconds": 375.88, "end_seconds": 380.4, "text": "and go to monitor."}, {"start_seconds": 377.56, "end_seconds": 382.48, "text": "Then select view CloudWatch logs."}, {"start_seconds": 380.4, "end_seconds": 384.48, "text": "Open the newly created log stream and"}, {"start_seconds": 382.48, "end_seconds": 385.92, "text": "inspect the function output."}, {"start_seconds": 384.48, "end_seconds": 388.12, "text": "Confirm that the configured event"}, {"start_seconds": 385.92, "end_seconds": 389.96, "text": "message appears in the output."}, {"start_seconds": 388.12, "end_seconds": 391.2, "text": "This validates more than simple function"}, {"start_seconds": 389.96, "end_seconds": 392.44, "text": "activity."}, {"start_seconds": 391.2, "end_seconds": 394.88, "text": "It confirms that the scheduled"}, {"start_seconds": 392.44, "end_seconds": 396.12, "text": "invocation reached the Lambda target,"}, {"start_seconds": 394.88, "end_seconds": 398.08, "text": "and that the function received the"}, {"start_seconds": 396.12, "end_seconds": 399.64, "text": "expected payload."}, {"start_seconds": 398.08, "end_seconds": 400.72, "text": "The practical verification chain is"}, {"start_seconds": 399.64, "end_seconds": 403.64, "text": "therefore,"}, {"start_seconds": 400.72, "end_seconds": 405.84, "text": "scheduled time passes, Lambda runs,"}, {"start_seconds": 403.64, "end_seconds": 409.48, "text": "Lambda prints the event, and CloudWatch"}, {"start_seconds": 405.84, "end_seconds": 409.48, "text": "logs shows that printed event."}, {"start_seconds": 410.16, "end_seconds": 414.36, "text": "A Lambda function was just created, but"}, {"start_seconds": 412.44, "end_seconds": 416.16, "text": "no CloudWatch log group is visible"}, {"start_seconds": 414.36, "end_seconds": 417.92, "text": "before the scheduled run. What is the"}, {"start_seconds": 416.16, "end_seconds": 419.8, "text": "most likely explanation?"}, {"start_seconds": 417.92, "end_seconds": 421.92, "text": "Think about when Lambda has actually had"}, {"start_seconds": 419.8, "end_seconds": 423.44, "text": "an opportunity to produce output. The"}, {"start_seconds": 421.92, "end_seconds": 425.12, "text": "correct answer is B."}, {"start_seconds": 423.44, "end_seconds": 427.72, "text": "The log group or log stream may not"}, {"start_seconds": 425.12, "end_seconds": 429.84, "text": "exist until Lambda is invoked. A missing"}, {"start_seconds": 427.72, "end_seconds": 433.56, "text": "log group before the first run is not by"}, {"start_seconds": 429.84, "end_seconds": 435.52, "text": "itself proof that the schedule failed."}, {"start_seconds": 433.56, "end_seconds": 436.64, "text": "Suppose the expected log output is"}, {"start_seconds": 435.52, "end_seconds": 438.64, "text": "missing."}, {"start_seconds": 436.64, "end_seconds": 440.76, "text": "Start with the schedule configuration,"}, {"start_seconds": 438.64, "end_seconds": 442.88, "text": "not by changing Lambda code."}, {"start_seconds": 440.76, "end_seconds": 445.2, "text": "First, confirm that the configured date"}, {"start_seconds": 442.88, "end_seconds": 447.88, "text": "and time have actually passed, and that"}, {"start_seconds": 445.2, "end_seconds": 450.76, "text": "the schedule was set for a future time."}, {"start_seconds": 447.88, "end_seconds": 452.52, "text": "Next, verify the selected time zone. An"}, {"start_seconds": 450.76, "end_seconds": 454.64, "text": "incorrect zone can make an invocation"}, {"start_seconds": 452.52, "end_seconds": 456.56, "text": "seem missing when it is simply scheduled"}, {"start_seconds": 454.64, "end_seconds": 458.44, "text": "differently than expected."}, {"start_seconds": 456.56, "end_seconds": 460.52, "text": "Then, check the flexible time window"}, {"start_seconds": 458.44, "end_seconds": 462.8, "text": "setting, and confirm that the intended"}, {"start_seconds": 460.52, "end_seconds": 463.96, "text": "Lambda function and JSON input are"}, {"start_seconds": 462.8, "end_seconds": 466.08, "text": "configured."}, {"start_seconds": 463.96, "end_seconds": 467.8, "text": "Only after those checks should you focus"}, {"start_seconds": 466.08, "end_seconds": 469.96, "text": "on the permission relationship between"}, {"start_seconds": 467.8, "end_seconds": 472.32, "text": "the schedule and Lambda."}, {"start_seconds": 469.96, "end_seconds": 473.64, "text": "This order avoids unnecessary changes"}, {"start_seconds": 472.32, "end_seconds": 475.44, "text": "and aligns troubleshooting with the"}, {"start_seconds": 473.64, "end_seconds": 479.24, "text": "components that control timing,"}, {"start_seconds": 475.44, "end_seconds": 479.24, "text": "targeting, and delivered input."}, {"start_seconds": 480.84, "end_seconds": 484.64, "text": "For scenario questions, map the"}, {"start_seconds": 482.92, "end_seconds": 486.24, "text": "requirement to the component that owns"}, {"start_seconds": 484.64, "end_seconds": 487.92, "text": "that responsibility."}, {"start_seconds": 486.24, "end_seconds": 491.0, "text": "To invoke a service at a configured"}, {"start_seconds": 487.92, "end_seconds": 493.28, "text": "time, use an EventBridge schedule."}, {"start_seconds": 491.0, "end_seconds": 494.48, "text": "For custom processing, choose Lambda as"}, {"start_seconds": 493.28, "end_seconds": 496.68, "text": "the target."}, {"start_seconds": 494.48, "end_seconds": 499.4, "text": "To pass data to that function, configure"}, {"start_seconds": 496.68, "end_seconds": 501.84, "text": "valid JSON input on the schedule."}, {"start_seconds": 499.4, "end_seconds": 504.08, "text": "For verification, use Lambda monitor and"}, {"start_seconds": 501.84, "end_seconds": 505.8, "text": "CloudWatch logs, where the printed event"}, {"start_seconds": 504.08, "end_seconds": 507.68, "text": "can be inspected."}, {"start_seconds": 505.8, "end_seconds": 509.24, "text": "This mapping is more valuable than"}, {"start_seconds": 507.68, "end_seconds": 510.56, "text": "memorizing a particular console"}, {"start_seconds": 509.24, "end_seconds": 512.08, "text": "sequence."}, {"start_seconds": 510.56, "end_seconds": 514.04, "text": "It helps you recognize the correct"}, {"start_seconds": 512.08, "end_seconds": 517.16, "text": "service and setting when the wording of"}, {"start_seconds": 514.04, "end_seconds": 517.16, "text": "a scenario changes."}, {"start_seconds": 517.32, "end_seconds": 523.36, "text": "Retain four assessment-relevant facts."}, {"start_seconds": 520.84, "end_seconds": 525.4, "text": "First, use an EventBridge schedule when"}, {"start_seconds": 523.36, "end_seconds": 526.6, "text": "a target must be invoked at a configured"}, {"start_seconds": 525.4, "end_seconds": 529.2, "text": "time."}, {"start_seconds": 526.6, "end_seconds": 531.0, "text": "Second, the JSON input payload is"}, {"start_seconds": 529.2, "end_seconds": 532.44, "text": "delivered to the Lambda function as its"}, {"start_seconds": 531.0, "end_seconds": 534.88, "text": "event."}, {"start_seconds": 532.44, "end_seconds": 536.8, "text": "Third, Lambda execution permissions and"}, {"start_seconds": 534.88, "end_seconds": 538.32, "text": "the EventBridge invocation role serve"}, {"start_seconds": 536.8, "end_seconds": 540.16, "text": "separate purposes."}, {"start_seconds": 538.32, "end_seconds": 542.04, "text": "One supports function actions, while the"}, {"start_seconds": 540.16, "end_seconds": 543.52, "text": "other allows the schedule to invoke the"}, {"start_seconds": 542.04, "end_seconds": 546.96, "text": "target."}, {"start_seconds": 543.52, "end_seconds": 546.96, "text": "Finally, CloudWatch"}, {"start_seconds": 547.04, "end_seconds": 550.6, "text": "logs provide a practical verification"}, {"start_seconds": 548.88, "end_seconds": 552.0, "text": "can be expected."}, {"start_seconds": 550.6, "end_seconds": 554.68, "text": "Combine these facts with timing"}, {"start_seconds": 552.0, "end_seconds": 556.72, "text": "awareness, choose a future time, select"}, {"start_seconds": 554.68, "end_seconds": 560.44, "text": "the correct time zone, and disable the"}, {"start_seconds": 556.72, "end_seconds": 560.44, "text": "flexible window for this exercise."}, {"start_seconds": 560.48, "end_seconds": 564.96, "text": "The complete pattern is concise."}, {"start_seconds": 562.92, "end_seconds": 567.08, "text": "Create a Lambda function that prints its"}, {"start_seconds": 564.96, "end_seconds": 568.48, "text": "received event and has CloudWatch logs"}, {"start_seconds": 567.08, "end_seconds": 570.36, "text": "permissions."}, {"start_seconds": 568.48, "end_seconds": 572.48, "text": "Create an EventBridge schedule for a"}, {"start_seconds": 570.36, "end_seconds": 574.72, "text": "future date and time using the correct"}, {"start_seconds": 572.48, "end_seconds": 575.92, "text": "time zone and a disabled flexible time"}, {"start_seconds": 574.72, "end_seconds": 577.88, "text": "window."}, {"start_seconds": 575.92, "end_seconds": 580.12, "text": "Configure Lambda as the target and"}, {"start_seconds": 577.88, "end_seconds": 582.28, "text": "provide valid JSON input."}, {"start_seconds": 580.12, "end_seconds": 584.56, "text": "Create or select the invocation role"}, {"start_seconds": 582.28, "end_seconds": 586.92, "text": "that permits EventBridge to call Lambda."}, {"start_seconds": 584.56, "end_seconds": 588.92, "text": "After the scheduled time passes, inspect"}, {"start_seconds": 586.92, "end_seconds": 590.72, "text": "Lambda monitor and CloudWatch logs for"}, {"start_seconds": 588.92, "end_seconds": 592.56, "text": "the configured message."}, {"start_seconds": 590.72, "end_seconds": 594.48, "text": "When the exercise is complete, delete"}, {"start_seconds": 592.56, "end_seconds": 596.56, "text": "the schedule and function if they are no"}, {"start_seconds": 594.48, "end_seconds": 598.64, "text": "longer needed and review any role"}, {"start_seconds": 596.56, "end_seconds": 601.72, "text": "created specifically for the exercise as"}, {"start_seconds": 598.64, "end_seconds": 604.64, "text": "part of normal cleanup."}, {"start_seconds": 601.72, "end_seconds": 606.52, "text": "Like, share, and subscribe for more"}, {"start_seconds": 604.64, "end_seconds": 608.6, "text": "certification training."}, {"start_seconds": 606.52, "end_seconds": 610.76, "text": "Visit techstudydeck.com"}, {"start_seconds": 608.6, "end_seconds": 613.04, "text": "and use the free companion study guide,"}, {"start_seconds": 610.76, "end_seconds": 616.36, "text": "flash cards, and practice questions to"}, {"start_seconds": 613.04, "end_seconds": 616.36, "text": "reinforce this workflow."}]}